":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"uxHR2GuFsVYPi0H5wi89XA","review_id":"h9BpFOErvM8TBLtPJqIkzQ","date":"2021-06-20T16:48:11","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9326781034469604,"text_excerpt":"Love coming here!! First of all, it's easy to miss because outside of the sign hanging above the door, you wouldn't really be able to tell anything is behind the wall. However, when security lets you in, it's a very cute place with a perfect patio area! They also have a tv outside, but it wasn't on when I went. They have a happy hour into 6 or 7, and the happy hour drinks I ordered were pretty good! I didn't order food, but I saw the waiter carrying tacos to a table and they looked very delicious. When I went with a group of friends, we were told they couldn't split the check, so one person paid and we all just paid that person back. They also have a nice clean bathroom that has a lot of ..."},{"business_id":"uxHR2GuFsVYPi0H5wi89XA","review_id":"GBoIKRsgr3EunTQ_QywUkg","date":"2021-06-25T17:16:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9318000674247742,"text_excerpt":"Great spot, with a really nice ambience. Feels like you're chilling in your coolest friend's basement - and this is meant as a very good thing! Great staff - very friendly and attentive. The seating is perfectly spaced, too - lots of room for you and some friends to relax. We came for the happy hour, and tried some of their drinks - the \"Down South\" was AMAZING (it has cayenne in it, so be warned). We also got a charcuterie board to snack on while we hung out, and it was pretty decent! Not the best we've had, but a decent amount of food. I have one complaint, and I hope the management sees this comment. We asked for some more water crackers to finish the charcuterie board (there weren't r..."},{"business_id":"uxHR2GuFsVYPi0H5wi89XA","review_id":"SJU_iTe2hh9_OAWiI7v4fA","date":"2021-07-24T15:49:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9269124865531921,"text_excerpt":"Great vibes and awesome bartenders. They have nice happy hour specials. We made a reservation based on their website recommendation. Also, recommend their charcuterie board. It's really cool that they change the colors of the walls based on the artist's work that is being featured."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"uxHR2GuFsVYPi0H5wi89XA","photo_id":"H9M3GCJO7yhJmgtS6AMQRQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/H9M3GCJO7yhJmgtS6AMQRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8942381143569946},{"business_id":"uxHR2GuFsVYPi0H5wi89XA","photo_id":"9VCe25IGQsBDq9zP2bB_9w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/9VCe25IGQsBDq9zP2bB_9w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8392838835716248},{"business_id":"uxHR2GuFsVYPi0H5wi89XA","photo_id":"C1YdK5c1JnFi1iBwCDwR_w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/C1YdK5c1JnFi1iBwCDwR_w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.838503360748291},{"business